## Model card

- **Name:** Mercury 2
- **Short description:** Inception Labs’ Mercury 2 is an earlier-generation diffusion LLM (128K context, 50K max output) optimized for high-throughput parallel decoding, with tool-calling and structured output support.
- **Provider / access:** Inception Labs API / hosted providers. Local metadata lists `inception/mercury-2`, pricing $0.25/$0.75 per 1M ($0.025 cached), and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Inception Labs docs reviewed 2026-11-10. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed source.
- **IDs:** `mercury-2`, `inception/mercury-2`.
- **Context window:** 128,000 tokens total; 50,000 max output.
- **Modalities:** Text and vision input; text output (per local metadata/docs context).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.25/$0.75 per 1M in/out ($0.025 cached input).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary diffusion LLM (closed weights). Architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

